{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["And they shall make an ark of shittim wood — since it is in construct state, ארון שִׁטִּים, therefore it is pointed with a ḥataf-pataḥ. And even though in the account of Betzalel's work we find that he made first the Mishkan and afterwards the vessels — the ark, the menorah, and the table — for where would he bring the ark and the table in? — all the while that the Mishkan exists only as a command, he needed to explain the making of the ark and the table first, for on account of the ark, which is the essential element of ״וְעָשׂוּ לִי מִקְדָּשׁ״, he needed to make the Mishkan."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:00.434039727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}